sequenceDiagram
    actor Cliente
    participant RLF as RateLimitFilter
    participant Auth as AuthController
    participant Lock as LoginLockoutService
    participant AM as AuthenticationManager
    participant UDS as UserDetailsServiceImpl
    participant Jwt as JwtService
    participant JAF as JwtAuthFilter
    participant SC as SecurityConfig<br/>(@PreAuthorize)
    participant Ctrl as Controller<br/>(ex.: SpecController)
    participant Svc as Service<br/>(ex.: SpecService)

    Note over Cliente,Svc: 1 — Login (POST /auth/login)
    Cliente->>RLF: POST /auth/login {email, senha}
    RLF->>Auth: dentro do limite por IP
    Auth->>Lock: conta bloqueada?
    Lock-->>Auth: não bloqueada
    Auth->>AM: authenticate(email, senha)
    AM->>UDS: loadUserByUsername(email)
    UDS-->>AM: UserDetails (role, senha em hash)
    AM->>AM: valida senha (BCrypt)
    AM-->>Auth: autenticado
    Auth->>Jwt: generateAccessToken + generateRefreshToken
    Jwt-->>Auth: access_token (8h) + refresh_token (7d)
    Auth-->>Cliente: 200 {access_token, refresh_token, role}

    Note over Cliente,Svc: 2 — Requisição autenticada (ex.: POST /specs/query)
    Cliente->>RLF: Authorization: Bearer access_token
    RLF->>JAF: dentro do limite por IP
    JAF->>Jwt: valida assinatura, expiração, type=ACCESS
    Jwt-->>JAF: claims (email, role)
    JAF->>UDS: loadUserByUsername(email)
    JAF->>JAF: popula SecurityContext
    JAF->>SC: encaminha requisição
    SC->>SC: @PreAuthorize checa role exigida
    SC->>Ctrl: autorizado
    Ctrl->>Svc: delega regra de negócio
    Svc-->>Ctrl: resultado
    Ctrl-->>Cliente: 200 (ou 4xx/5xx via GlobalExceptionHandler)
